	-- One status line per loop (owner rule: the arbiter that owns the character, the hatch loop, the tap loop and the
	-- remote chores each say what they do). Only Main and Hatch are logged ("MAIN now:" / "HATCH now:"), and only when
	-- the text changes to one not seen in the last 2 minutes (no flip-flop spam); Tap and Chores show in the panel only
